// 8x8 monochrome font (based on work by Marcel Sondaar). Vendored so builds
// are offline and reproducible.
//
// This is the fallback used only when no real face is installed — see
// engine.text.sfnt for the TrueType path that normally renders text. Glyphs
// here are monospaced and cover ASCII only, so paint stretches each one into
// the advance layout measured; the result is legible but not typography.
// Keeping it means the engine still draws something on a system with no usable
// font file, and that tests can run without depending on the host's fonts.
//
// Each glyph is eight bytes, one per row, with bit 0 the leftmost pixel.
